-----Terraform script to provision an AKS cluster-----

Step 1: Install Requirements
Terraform
Azure CLI
Step 2: Save the Terraform Script
Step 3: Initialize Terraform
CMD: terraform init
Step 4: Preview the Deployment Plan
CMD: terraform plan
Step 5: Apply the Plan (Deploy Resources)
CMD: terraform apply
Step 6: Verify AKS Cluster & Azure Monitor
CMD: az aks show --name (CLUSTER NAME) --resource-group (RESOURCE NAME) --query "provisioningState"
Step 7: Access the Cluster
CMD: az aks get-credentials --resource-group (GROUP NAME) --name (CLUSTER NAME)
     kubectl get nodes
